NG":"ENTRENAMENT","TRAINING BAG":"SAC D'ENTRENAR","TRAININGS":"ENTRENAMENTS","TRAININGS/WEEK":"ENTRENOS/SETM.","Tap the egg...":"Toca l'ou...","Tap to hatch":"Toca per eclosionar","Thanks for the walk!":"Gràcies per la passejada!","The Pokébox is empty":"La Pokébox és buida","The partner gets full EXP, the team 25%":"El company rep tota l'EXP, l'equip el 25%","The team is full (6)":"L'equip és ple (6)","Time to say goodbye. Hold UP":"És hora d'acomiadar-se. Mantén UP","To party":"Al grup","Training  ATK ":"Entrenament  ATC ","Training cap ATK ":"Límit ATC ","UP / DOWN to choose":"UP / DOWN per triar","UP/DOWN letter, START next":"UP/DOWN lletra, START següent","VIBRATION":"VIBRACIÓ","VIT ":"VIT ","WALK":"CAMINADA","WELCOME!":"BENVINGUT!","WILD BATTLE":"COMBAT SALVATGE","WORKOUT":"ENTRENO","Waiting for ":"Esperant ","Waiting for a friend...":"Esperant un amic...","Waiting for the host...":"Esperant l'amfitrió...","Waiting nearby...":"Esperant a prop...","Walk ":"Camina ","Wants to train!":"Vol entrenar!","Weekly goal! ":"Objectiu setmanal! ","Workout":"Entreno","Workouts":"Entrenos","Workouts you record":"Entrenaments que registres","Worn out...":"Esgotat...","YES":"SÍ","YOUR NAME":"EL TEU NOM","You beat ":"Has guanyat a ","You got a candy!":"Has aconseguit un caramel!","You lost...":"Has perdut...","You win!":"Has guanyat!","You won!":"Has guanyat!","Your adventure starts here! TamaWatch keeps you active, with your partner always by your side. Walk, run and train: it grows with you.":"La teva aventura comença aquí! TamaWatch et manté actiu, amb el teu company sempre al teu costat. Camina, corre i entrena: creix amb tu.","LANGUAGE":"IDIOMA","You found an egg! Walk to hatch it":"Has trobat un ou! Camina per eclosionar-lo","{0} hatched and joined your team!":"{0} ha eclosionat i s'ha unit a l'equip!","{0} hatched and went to the Pokébox!":"{0} ha eclosionat i ha anat a la Pokébox!","Eggs found":"Ous trobats","Hatched":"Eclosionat","Your partner":"El teu company","Your team":"El teu equip","Yum yum!":"Ñam ñam!","[Pokébox] ":"[Pokébox] ","anywhere, through your phone":"arreu, a través del mòbil","burn!":"cremada!","empty":"buit","from TEAM":"des d'EQUIP","h to go":"h per acabar","in a usual week":"en una setmana normal","keep up ":"mantens ","m: JOY +":"m: ALEGRIA +","now about ":"ara uns ","poison!":"verí!","space":"espai","vs ":"vs ","watch to watch, no phone":"de rellotge a rellotge, sense mòbil","{0}'s {1}{2}":"{1} de {0}{2}","TRADE":"INTERCANVI","Pick a pet to trade":"Tria qui vols intercanviar","START: offer":"START: ofereix","You give":"Dones","You get":"Reps","Traded!":"Intercanviat!","Joined your team!":"S'uneix al teu equip!","TRADE AGAIN":"UN ALTRE","Your team is empty":"El teu equip és buit","GUIDE":"GUIA","BASICS":"BÀSIC","EXP & LEVELS":"EXP I NIVELLS","FOOD & FRUIT":"MENJAR I FRUITA","EGGS":"OUS","BATTLES & GYMS":"COMBATS I GIMNASOS","TEAM & POKÉBOX":"EQUIP I POKÉBOX","BUTTONS":"BOTONS","Your partner lives on your watch. Feed it with the apple and bathe it with the drop. Its energy is your Body Battery, and it sleeps when you do. Its joy comes from your workouts. Being active earns it EXP, fruit and eggs.":"El teu company viu al rellotge. Dona-li menjar amb la poma i banya'l amb la gota. La seva energia és la teva Body Battery, i dorm quan tu dorms. La seva alegria ve dels teus entrenaments. Ser actiu li dona EXP, fruita i ous.","Each workout you record (5 min or more) fills joy and trains a stat: running SPEED, cycling and swimming DEFENSE, strength and gym ATTACK; walks, hikes and the rest train a random one. Joy slowly drops over a week, so keep up your trainings per week. The football has three mini-games.":"Cada entrenament que registres (5 min o més) omple l'alegria i entrena una estadística: córrer VELOCITAT, bici i natació DEFENSA, força i gimnàs ATAC; caminades, excursions i la resta, una a l'atzar. L'alegria baixa poc a poc durant una setmana: mantén els teus entrenaments setmanals. La pilota té tres minijocs.","Every 15,000 steps earns an egg, at most 2 in any 7 days. Steps carry over until you reach 15,000, but while you already have 2 eggs from the last 7 days they don't count. Open the app to collect it, then walk 1,000 to 3,000 steps to hatch it. It joins your team, or the Pokébox if the team is full.":"Cada 15.000 passos guanyes un ou, com a màxim 2 cada 7 dies. Els passos s'acumulen fins arribar a 15.000, però mentre ja tens 2 ous dels últims 7 dies no compten. Obre l'app per recollir-lo i camina de 1.000 a 3.000 passos per eclosionar-lo. S'uneix a l'equip, o a la Pokébox si l'equip és ple.","Fight wild creatures from the menu and beat the 8 gyms in order to earn badges. Hard gyms are tougher and stay closed while your Body Battery is 20% or less. Link battles let you fight a friend online through your phone, or nearby watch to watch.":"Lluita contra criatures salvatges des del menú i guanya els 8 gimnasos en ordre per aconseguir insígnies. Els gimnasos difícils són més durs i estan tancats mentre la teva Body Battery és del 20% o menys. Els combats enllaç et deixen lluitar amb un amic en línia a través del mòbil, o a prop, de rellotge a rellotge.","Your team holds 6: your partner plus 5. The rest wait in the Pokébox. There you can make any team member your partner, swap creatures between the team and the box, see their stats or release them.":"El teu equip té 6: el teu company i 5 més. La resta espera a la Pokébox. Allà pots fer company qualsevol membre de l'equip, intercanviar criatures entre l'equip i la Pokébox, veure'n les estadístiques o alliberar-les.","Vibration turns the buzz on or off. Care alerts send reminders when your partner needs you, and news about eggs. Trainings/week is your weekly workout target; it adjusts to what you really do. Language changes the whole app.":"Vibració activa o desactiva la vibració. Avisos t'envia recordatoris quan el teu company et necessita, i notícies dels ous. Entrenos/setm. és el teu objectiu setmanal d'entrenaments; s'ajusta al que fas de veritat. Idioma canvia tota l'app.","UP and DOWN move, START picks and BACK goes back. Hold UP, or pick the book, for the menu. In the Pokedex and the Pokébox, UP and DOWN turn pages until START picks on the page.":"UP i DOWN mouen, START tria i BACK torna enrere. Mantén UP, o tria el llibre, per al menú. A la Pokédex i a la Pokébox, UP i DOWN passen pàgines fins que START tria a la pàgina.","Every 50 steps give 1 EXP and every intensity minute 10 EXP. Steps add up over time: a few now and a few later still count. Battles give EXP too: wild fights a few times a day, gyms and link battles more. Your partner gets all of it and the rest of the team 25%. New levels teach moves and let it evolve.":"Cada 50 passos donen 1 EXP i cada minut d'intensitat 10 EXP. Els passos s'acumulen: uns quants ara i uns quants després també compten. Els combats també en donen: els salvatges unes quantes vegades al dia, els gimnasos i els combats enllaç més. El teu company ho rep tot i la resta de l'equip el 25%. Els nivells nous ensenyen moviments i el fan evolucionar.","Fruit is earned: an apple for every 2,000 steps (they add up over time, so 1,500 now and 500 later earn it), for every 20 active minutes and at each third of your step goal; a berry or an orange for each workout and for reaching your step goal; candy for your weekly goal and each gym win. Every species has a favourite fruit.":"La fruita es guanya: una poma per cada 2.000 passos (s'acumulen, així que 1.500 ara i 500 després també la guanyen), per cada 20 minuts actius i a cada terç del teu objectiu de passos; una baia o una taronja per cada entrenament i per arribar a l'objectiu de passos; caramels per l'objectiu setmanal i per cada gimnàs guanyat. Cada espècie té una fruita preferida.","Tough battle! FOOD -":"Combat dur! MENJAR -","Found an apple!":"Ha trobat una poma!","Found a blue berry!":"Ha trobat una baia blava!","Found an orange!":"Ha trobat una taronja!","Can't trade":"No es pot intercanviar","{0} plays {1} and you play {2}. A creature can only live in its own region, so trades need the same one. You can still have a link battle!":"{0} juga a {1} i tu a {2}. Una criatura només pot viure a la seva regió, així que per intercanviar cal la mateixa. Encara podeu fer un combat!","GOOD CARE":"BONES CURES","REGIONS":"REGIONS","The bar under your partner is its HP. Battles take it and it keeps what is left: your next battle starts from there. A battle that costs 40% or more of it also costs some food. HP refills by itself, from empty to full in 15 minutes. Each fruit gives some back at once, and so does every training game; a recorded activity gives back half of it.":"La barra sota el teu company són els seus PS. Els combats en treuen i es queda amb el que li queda: el següent combat comença des d'aquí. Un combat que li costa el 40% o més també li costa menjar. Els PS es recuperen sols, de buit a ple en 15 minuts. Cada fruita en torna una part de cop, i també cada joc d'entrenament; una activitat registrada en torna la meitat.","Look after your partner before a fight: when food, hygiene or joy is under half, its attacks miss more often (up to 4 in 10 when all three are empty). A training game sometimes finds a piece of fruit, at most one per game. Care alerts wait while you record an activity, so nothing buzzes mid-run.":"Cuida el teu company abans de lluitar: si el menjar, la higiene o l'alegria són per sota de la meitat, els seus atacs fallen més sovint (fins a 4 de cada 10 si tots tres són buits). Un joc d'entrenament de vegades troba una fruita, com a molt una per partida. Els avisos esperen mentre registres una activitat, així res vibra a mitja cursa.","This TamaWatch holds the {0} region. Every region is its own version of the app, with its own game: pick another on the TamaWatch website. Link battles work with friends of any region; trades need the same one.":"Aquest TamaWatch té la regió de {0}. Cada regió és una versió pròpia de l'app, amb la seva partida: tria'n una altra al web de TamaWatch. Els combats en línia funcionen amb amics de qualsevol regió; els intercanvis necessiten la mateixa.","New here? Read the GUIDE: it explains HP, food, eggs, battles and more. Hold UP, or pick the book, and choose GUIDE.":"Ets nou? Llegeix la GUIA: explica els PS, el menjar, els ous, els combats i més. Mantén AMUNT, o tria el llibre, i escull GUIA.","Every 50 steps give 1 EXP. Each activity you record gives EXP by its length and sport, per minute: running or swimming 20, strength or gym 27, cycling 15, hiking 12, walking 8, anything else 15 (so 45 minutes of weights pay like an hour's run). Intensity minutes outside your recorded activities give 10 EXP each. Battles give EXP too: wild fights a few times a day, gyms and link battles more. Your partner gets all of it and the rest of the team 25%. New levels teach moves and let it evolve.":"Cada 50 passes donen 1 EXP. Cada activitat que registres dona EXP segons la durada i l'esport, per minut: córrer o nedar 20, força o gimnàs 27, bici 15, excursió 12, caminar 8, qualsevol altre 15 (45 minuts de peses valen com una hora de córrer). Els minuts d'intensitat fora de les activitats registrades donen 10 EXP cadascun. Els combats també donen EXP: els salvatges unes quantes vegades al dia, els gimnasos i els combats en línia més. El teu company se l'emporta tota i la resta de l'equip un 25%. Els nivells nous ensenyen moviments i el deixen evolucionar.","VICTORY!":"VICTÒRIA!","DEFEAT":"DERROTA","Wild":"Salvatge","VS":"VS","{0} turns":"{0} torns","1 turn":"1 torn","Every 15,000 steps earns an egg, at most 2 in any 7 days. Steps carry over until you reach 15,000, but while you already have 2 eggs from the last 7 days they don't count. Open the app to collect it, then walk 1,000 to 3,000 steps to hatch it. Each step counts once: while an egg waits, your steps hatch it, and only the steps after that count toward the next egg. The steps of your runs and walks count too, even on days you don't open the app. It joins your team, or the Pokébox if the team is full.":"Cada 15.000 passos guanyes un ou, com a màxim 2 cada 7 dies. Els passos s'acumulen fins arribar a 15.000, però mentre ja tens 2 ous dels últims 7 dies no compten. Obre l'app per recollir-lo i camina de 1.000 a 3.000 passos per fer-lo eclosionar. Cada pas compta una sola vegada: mentre un ou espera, els passos el fan eclosionar, i només els de després compten per al següent ou. Els passos de les teves curses i caminades també compten, fins i tot els dies que no obres l'app. S'uneix al teu equip, o a la Pokébox si l'equip és ple.","Your team holds 6: your partner plus 5. The rest wait in the Pokébox. There you can make any team member your partner, swap creatures between the team and the Pokébox, see their stats or release them. Only your partner gets hungry, tired, bored or dirty: the others' food, joy, energy and hygiene climb back to full within 24 hours, and their HP within 15 minutes. Each one keeps its own when it becomes your partner.":"El teu equip té 6: el teu company i 5 més. La resta espera a la Pokébox. Allà pots fer company qualsevol membre de l'equip, intercanviar criatures entre l'equip i la Pokébox, veure'n les estadístiques o alliberar-les. Només el teu company passa gana, cansament, avorriment o brutícia: el menjar, l'alegria, l'energia i la higiene dels altres tornen a ple en 24 hores, i els seus PS en 15 minuts. Cadascun conserva els seus quan es fa el teu company.","Daily gift: 2 fruit!":"Regal del dia: 2 fruites!","Missed because it's hungry!":"Ha fallat perquè té gana!","Missed because it wants a bath!":"Ha fallat perquè vol un bany!","Missed because it wants to train!":"Ha fallat perquè vol entrenar!","Hardy":"Fort","Lonely":"Esquiu","Brave":"Audaç","Adamant":"Ferm","Naughty":"Entremaliat","Bold":"Agosarat","Docile":"Dòcil","Relaxed":"Plàcid","Impish":"Trapella","Lax":"Fluix","Timid":"Poruc","Hasty":"Enfeinat","Serious":"Seriós","Jolly":"Alegre","Naive":"Ingenu","Modest":"Modest","Mild":"Afable","Quiet":"Mans","Bashful":"Tímid","Rash":"Esbojarrat","Calm":"Serè","Gentle":"Amable","Sassy":"Insolent","Careful":"Caut","Quirky":"Rar","BAG":"BOSSA","It won't have any effect.":"No tindrà cap efecte.","{0} ate the {1}!":"{0} s'ha menjat: {1}!","Its HP went up!":"Ha recuperat PS!","It feels better!":"Ja es troba millor!","REMATCH!":"REVENJA!","RIVAL BATTLE":"COMBAT DE RIVAL","{0} wants to battle! Hold UP":"{0} vol lluitar! Mantén UP","Great care made it stronger!":"Les bones cures l'han fet més fort!","Better care would have made it stronger.":"Amb millors cures seria més fort.","ROUTE CROSSING":"CRUÏLLA DE RUTA","SPLASH!":"XAP!","A bird swooped down!":"Un ocell l'ha atrapat!","Enough training for today":"Prou entrenament per avui","START: hop  UP/DOWN: sideways":"START: salta  UP/DOWN: costat","BATTLE EXTRAS":"EXTRES DE COMBAT","GROWING STRONGER":"FER-SE FORT","START hop, UP/DOWN move":"START salta, UP/DOWN mou","Every creature has a nature that raises one stat by 10% and lowers another (its summary shows which, in orange and blue). In battle, the BAG lets it eat fruit: an apple brings back HP, a blue berry cures poison and burns, an orange wakes it up and cures paralysis, ice and confusion; eating takes the turn. Each of yours that beats a foe earns that foe's EXP. Beaten gym leaders come back stronger two days later for a rematch, and your rival KAI turns up every few days.":"Cada criatura té un caràcter que puja una estadística un 10% i en baixa una altra (el seu resum ho mostra, en taronja i blau). En combat, la BOSSA li deixa menjar fruita: una poma li torna PS, una baia blava cura el verí i les cremades, una taronja el desperta i cura la paràlisi, el gel i la confusió; menjar gasta el torn. Cadascun dels teus que venç un rival guanya l'EXP d'aquest rival. Els líders de gimnàs vençuts tornen més forts dos dies després per a la revenja, i el teu rival KAI apareix cada pocs dies.","Stats grow slowly and steadily, like your own fitness: each workout adds 1 point and 1 more per half hour (at most 4), each training game up to 3 (the first 3 games a day) and each gym win 1 to 3. Great care until it evolves (few care mistakes, a strong bond) adds 3 to each stat. Route Crossing trains DEFENSE: hop as far as you can over grass, paths, rivers and railways; it only ends when you are hit or fall in.":"Les estadístiques creixen a poc a poc i sense parar, com la teva forma física: cada entrenament suma 1 punt i 1 més per cada mitja hora (com a màxim 4), cada joc d'entrenament fins a 3 (els 3 primers jocs del dia) i cada victòria de gimnàs d'1 a 3. Unes bones cures fins que evoluciona (pocs errors, un vincle fort) sumen 3 a cada estadística. Cruïlla de ruta entrena la DEFENSA: salta tan lluny com puguis per herba, camins, rius i vies del tren; només s'acaba quan et toquen o caus a l'aigua.","BEST {0}":"RÈCORD {0}","NEW BEST!":"NOU RÈCORD!","Daily gift: 1 fruit!":"Regal del dia: 1 fruita!","TACKLE":"ENVESTIDA","SCRATCH":"ESGARRAPADA","POUND":"COP","FURY ATTACK":"ATAC FÚRIA","QUICK ATTACK":"ATAC RÀPID","SWIFT":"ESTRELLES","BODY SLAM":"PLACATGE","DOUBLE-EDGE":"DOBLE FILO","HYPER BEAM":"HIPERRAIG","PECK":"PICOTADA","EMBER":"BRASA","FIRE PUNCH":"PUNY FOC","FLAMETHROWER":"LLANÇAFLAMES","FIRE BLAST":"LLAMARADA","BUBBLE":"BOMBOLLA","WATER GUN":"PISTOLA AIGUA","WATERFALL":"CASCADA","SURF":"SURF","HYDRO PUMP":"HIDROBOMBA","SPARK":"ESPURNA","THUNDERSHOCK":"IMPACTRUENO","THUNDERPUNCH":"PUNY TRO","THUNDERBOLT":"LLAMP","THUNDER":"TRO","ABSORB":"ABSORCIÓ","VINE WHIP":"FUET CEPA","RAZOR LEAF":"FULLA AFILADA","MEGA DRAIN":"MEGAABSORCIÓ","SOLAR BEAM":"RAIG SOLAR","AURORA BEAM":"RAIG AURORA","ICE PUNCH":"PUNY GEL","ICE BEAM":"RAIG GEL","BLIZZARD":"VENTISCA","KARATE CHOP":"COP KÀRATE","SEISMIC TOSS":"SÍSMIC","SUBMISSION":"SUBMISSIÓ","HI JUMP KICK":"PUNTADA SALT","POISON STING":"FIBLÓ VERÍ","ACID":"ÀCID","SLUDGE":"RESIDUS","SLUDGE BOMB":"BOMBA LLOT","BONE CLUB":"ÒS PORRA","DIG":"EXCAVAR","EARTHQUAKE":"TERRATRÈMOL","WING ATTACK":"ATAC ALA","DRILL PECK":"PICO TALADRO","FLY":"VOLAR","PSYWAVE":"PSICOONA","CONFUSION":"CONFUSIÓ","PSYBEAM":"PSICORAIG","PSYCHIC":"PSÍQUIC","BUG BITE":"PICADURA","PIN MISSILE":"PIN MÍSSIL","LEECH LIFE":"CHUPAVIDES","MEGAHORN":"MEGACORN","BUG BUZZ":"ZUMBIT","X-SCISSOR":"TIJERA X","ROCK SMASH":"TRENCAROQUES","ROCK THROW":"LLANÇAROQUES","ROCK SLIDE":"ALLAU ROCA","ANCIENTPOWER":"PODER ANCESTRAL","LICK":"LLEPADA","NIGHT SHADE":"TENEBRES","SHADOW BALL":"BOLA OMBRA","DRAGON RAGE":"FÚRIA DRAC","DRAGON CLAW":"URPA DRAC","OUTRAGE":"ENFADAMENT","BITE":"MOSSEGADA","CRUNCH":"TRITURAR","IRON HEAD":"CAP DE FERRO","FLASH CANNON":"FOCUS RESPLENDENT","DAZZLE GLEAM":"BRILL ENLLUERNADOR","PLAY ROUGH":"CARANTOINA","MOONBLAST":"FORÇA LUNAR","SWORDS DANCE":"DANSA ESPASES","AGILITY":"AGILITAT","BARRIER":"BARRERA","AMNESIA":"AMNÈSIA","NASTY PLOT":"MAQUINACIÓ","DRAGON DANCE":"DANSA DRAC","BULK UP":"CORPULÈNCIA","GROWL":"GRUNY","LEER":"MALICIA","SCREECH":"XISCLE","STRING SHOT":"DISPAR SEDA","RECOVER":"RECUPERACIÓ","SOFT-BOILED":"AMORTIDOR","STRUGGLE":"FORCEIG","DARK PULSE":"POLS FOSC","NORMAL":"NORMAL","FIRE":"FOC","WATER":"AIGUA","ELECTRIC":"ELÈCTRIC","GRASS":"PLANTA","ICE":"GEL","FIGHTING":"LLUITA","POISON":"VERÍ","GROUND":"TERRA","FLYING":"VOLADOR","BUG":"BESTIOLA","ROCK":"ROCA","GHOST":"FANTASMA","DRAGON":"DRAC","DARK":"SINISTRE","STEEL":"ACER","FAIRY":"FADA"}